en politieke ambities vergroten de betekenis van het onderzoek. Terwijl verleden en heden steeds dichter bij elkaar komen, moet Pitt vaststellen wie belang heeft bij de vondsten en welke dreiging zich achter de afzonderlijke gebeurtenissen verbergt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/authors/67667/dirk-cussler/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p334725550"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-009.json#86","checked_at":"2026-11-02T18:57:00.000Z","note":"CrescentDawn16November2010, exact Dutch Wassende maan9789044332551. Primary publisher expressly confirms Dirk+Clive joint writing; no narrator misclassification. Historical prologue remains fiction, not a separate Work."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/authors/67667/dirk-cussler/","https://www.clive-cussler-books.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Clive-Cussler-Novels-Chronological-Reading-List.pdf","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15399488W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p334725550"],"review":"content-review-008.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Dirk Cussler","role":"joint original author"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":13648947,"sha256":"4d2f04e398057747bf4e71bf58cf73a15b1fb9139aa57ecb728fccb0699213af","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact printing-year claim."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T18:57:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-009"}},{"ref":"m2","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e2"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e2","w